/apps/1478160/extras/d2132d2b0fbe19289cbcaebf7d510924.webp?t=1686650483\" /></div>\uff1aGemstones provide Nyaruru new skills.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478160/extras/85c52d9ca3b8a2f5d42a56c797edfaec.webp?t=1686650483\" /></div>\uff1aAccessories have specific effects to help Nyaruru during BOSS fighting and map exploring. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478160/extras/0b07316db72fd7758e0e5b5fab7e5fca.avif?t=1686650483\" /></div><br>Dive and thrust downward quickly. Generate an energy wave and cause damage to the enemies around Nyaruru, or even behind her! You will like this if you have to turn your back to your enemy.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478160/extras/3636a4da4c3a6a54892b6b0500b32fa9.avif?t=1686650483\" /></div><br>Keep flipping over in the air and attacking everything near Nyaruru, bounce after hit and reset the double jump and dash. You will like this if your enemy can fly into the air and you have a hard time reaching them.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In addition of that, there are also some interesting items such as\uff1a</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478160/extras/d0b25fe2bf400c80fb4fc06f4be60b3e.webp?t=1686650483\" /></div>It will shine when Nyaruru gets close to the Catcoin, and make Nyaruru easier to find the hidden treasure!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1478160/extras/a59dc601182b09383df102b2943737a2.webp?t=1686650483\" /></div>With this weight gear, Nyaruru can squash the enemy by stomping on their head.",
